# neptune-admin-fe

**Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) at the repo root before writing code.** It is the source of
truth; this file is the short form. The other `.mdc` files here cover DTOs (`api-dtos`), UI
components (`ui-components`), Tailwind tokens (`tailwind-tokens`), and Sonar/a11y
(`sonarqube`).

Next 16 App Router `src/`, React 19, TS strict, TW v4 (`globals.css` `@theme`), RQ + axios,
Iconify/sonner/recharts/libphonenumber-js. `@/*`→`./src/*`. React Compiler on — no gratuitous
memo. Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before using a new Next API.

## Branches

Work on `hamid`, push `origin/hamid`, PR into **`origin/dev`** (the latest). The backend is `connect-codeswift/Neptune-Ehss-BE`
on `origin/Staging`, and it serves five frontends.

## Two apps, one tree

`(auth)/` unified login+MFA · `[company]/[site]/` org admin (org token) · `super/(dashboard)/`
CodeSwift staff (staff token) · `super/(auth)/` bootstrap only. No middleware — gating is
client-side via `DashboardAuthGate` and `TenantContextProvider`.

Three tokens in `src/lib/auth-tokens.ts` (auth / org / mfa). `src/lib/axiosInstance.ts` picks
one per request from `BODY_CREDENTIAL_AUTH_PATHS`, `MFA_BEARER_AUTH_PATHS`,
`STAFF_ONLY_AUTH_PATHS`, else `orgToken || authToken`. A new endpoint that doesn't follow
"org token if present" must be added to the right list.

## Data layer

`src/services/*.service.ts` (axios only) → `src/hooks/use*.ts` (React Query, exported query-key
consts) → `src/components/features/*`. Unwrap `ApiResponse<T>` with `assertApiSuccess` +
`unwrapDataModel`/`unwrapList` from `src/lib/api-response.ts` — never read `.dataModel` in a
component. The contract is `FEGuides/AdminDashboard.md` in `connect-codeswift/Neptune-Ehss-BE`, not
`.docs/swagger.json`.

## Dirs

`inputs/` forms · `ui/` chrome (Button/Table/Modal/…) · `layouts/` shells · `features/<domain>/`
page composition · `utils/` `lib/` `providers/` `types/` · `dtos/req` + `dtos/res`
(Payload/Response) · `public/sidebar/` Figma assets.

Named exports. Barrel `components/*/index.ts`. `"use client"` only when needed. Tokens:
`blue-normal` `#0891a6`, `darkest`, `gray`, `lightgray`, `green`/`red`/`yellow`. Glass:
`bg-white/62`, `rounded-[20px]`, soft dual shadow.

## Verify

`npm run lint` and `npm run build`. No tests.
